From fcfb91ed63b0c1e99da3f8fba52ce76a05846e5e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kholin <oodzchen@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 13:25:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] touchpad: add OnePlus Pad 2 Pro ColorOS acceleration, DWT,
 and tap quirks

Match the OnePlus Pad 2 Pro official pogo keyboard touchpad (0x22D9:0x3869)
with ModelOnePlusOPD2413Touchpad=1 to:
- Replicate the ColorOS 16 4-segment cursor acceleration curve and slider
  sensitivity factors for ADAPTIVE profile while keeping scroll speed stock.
- Disable software DisableWhileTyping by default because the keyboard MCU
  enforces ~160 ms key-down touchpad suppression in firmware.
- Raise tap timeout to 220 ms and tap move threshold to 2.0 mm (ColorOS).
- Smooth back-to-back UART timestamp intervals (20 ms / 8 ms) and disable
  false jump discards after firmware wakeups.

Co-Authored-By: Antigravity <noreply@deepmind.google>
